<title>AUSTRALIA: S&amp;P says Australia's Victoria a step closer to AAA.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P says Australia's Victoria a step closer to AAA.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit ratings agency Standard and Poor's said on Thursday Australia's Victoria state had taken a step closer to AAA status with its 1997/98 budget.</p>
<p>&quot;I think they have certainly taken a step closer to AAA, but we have not taken any rating action at the moment,&quot; said S&amp;P's director of public finance ratings, Rick Shepherd.</p>
<p>Victoria state's long-term domestic debt is rated AA-plus.</p>
</text>
